      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Given any number, find the factors of that number. Then, return the sum of odd factors."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "For example, if you're given 18,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "All the factors of 18 are {1, 2, 3, 6, 9, 18}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "And, the odd factors of 18 are {1, 3, 9}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "So, the sum of odd factors of 18 = 1 + 3 + 9 = 13"
